  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMECEA PLENARY ASSEMBLY 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AMECEA Executive Board shall be hosting the 19th AMECEA Plenary Assembly in Addis Ababa, Ethiopia Friday 13th to Monday 23rd July 2018. As the highest decision making organ of AMECEA, the Plenary Assembly brings together all the members of  the Episcopate from the member Episcopal Conferences of the Association. These include the eight Episcopal conferences of Eritrea, Ethiopia, Kenya, Malawi, South Sudan &amp; Sudan, Tanzania, Uganda and Zambia. The plenary is conducted in two sessions; the study,  and  business session. During the study session other agents of evangelization and partners of the Association will attend. 300 delegates are expected to attend this plenary. 
This project is thus a &#xa3;15, 000 contribution of CAFOD as an AMECEA partner to facilitate the hosting of this plenary.</narrative>
  </description>
